    "created_at": "2024-12-12T10:42:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-12T10:42:45Z",
    "body": "### For completeness\n\nChannel types:\n```\nRGB\nRGBA\nLUM (one value for all of RGB)\nLUMA (one value for RGB, one for A)\n```\n\nScalar types:\n```\nUint8 (normalized)\nUint16 (normalized)\nFloat16\nFloat32\n```\n\nGiven that APIs using `ImageData` do not support custom shaders I see no call for supporting\n- Integer formats\n- Higher precision formats\n- Component swizzling\n- RED/RG data",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
